+/-- The quantum relative entropy `𝐃(ρ‖σ) := Tr[ρ (log ρ - log σ)]`. Also called
+the Umegaki quantum relative entropy, when it's necessary to distinguish from other
+relative entropies. -/
+def qRelativeEnt (ρ σ : MState d) : ENNReal :=
